usiness-card","Logo on Business Card preview",{"images":184,"spanFullWidth":6},[185],{"type":186,"imageUrl":140,"imageAlt":187,"hasBorder":6,"alignment":173},"logo-on-website","Logo on Website preview",{"images":189,"spanFullWidth":6},[190],{"type":191,"imageUrl":140,"imageAlt":192,"hasBorder":6,"alignment":173},"logo-on-signage","Signage preview","Keep editing","\u002Fmaker\u002Fadmin\u002Flogo\u002F16bc9f29-9f5c-421b-a3dc-502728593b91","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.design.com\u002Fmaker\u002Fadmin\u002Flogo\u002Fishomepage","Gym Fitness Barbell","2026-07-16T02:58:33.97","gym-fitness-barbell-2242241","Gym Fitness Barbell Logo","Introducing our Gym Fitness Barbell logo, a perfect emblem that encompasses the essence of strength and determination. Combining vintage aesthetics with a touch of grunge, this logo is a symbol of commitment to physical fitness. Represented by a star, it signifies the achievement and success one can attain through training and exercise. Featuring a lettermark design, it captures the key aspects of fitness, including bodybuilding, weightlifting, and crossfit. The prominent barbell and dumbbell images serve as a reminder of the power and endurance required in workouts. Whether you're a seasoned athlete or a beginner, this logo embodies the spirit of fitness, encouraging you to push beyond your limits and achieve your goals. Join us on this journey to a fit and healthy lifestyle.","https:\u002F\u002Fdynamic.design.com\u002Fasset\u002Flogo\u002F16bc9f29-9f5c-421b-a3dc-502728593b91\u002Flogo-search-grid-desktop?logoTemplateVersion=1&v=639197675139700000",{"template":203},{"name":196,"token":68,"type":72},[],{"bc-mp-4713-screenshot-prevention":144,"bc-gt-9740-ai-edit-cta":206},"bc-gt-9740-disabled",{"maker_priority":208},{"template_type":72,"logo_template_token":68,"is_free":6,"is_logoless":6,"logo_type":32},"95bbfdc6-dbfd-4037-9298-496c19fbf827","https:\u002F\u002Fdynamic.design.com"," Logo","AI Logo Editor","Customise this  logo in seconds. Create a lo